    "text": "By Nyesha Stone ,\n1 days ago On November 1, 2025, thousands of families didn’t receive their SNAP (food stamp) payments. For over two weeks, families across the country scrambled to figure out how to get food for their families. Even though payments have been restored, a lot of families have been struggling throughout the year, so adding this on to their plate has created an even deeper ripple effect. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 6",
